  ('lying-t-bar-row', 'chest-supported-row-machine', 'full', 'equipment', 'Both brace the torso against a pad so the lower back can''t cheat the pull, delivering a comparable mid-back rowing stimulus.', 'mechanistic', 'strong', 3),
  ('reverse-grip-tricep-pushdown', 'oh-tricep-ext', 'full', 'preference', 'A cited study found the overhead position, which stretches the triceps'' long head further, drove substantially more growth over 12 weeks than pressdowns did.', 'cited_study', 'strong', 3),
  ('back-squat', 'barbell-bulgarian-split-squat', 'full', 'preference', 'Offered as a second stand-in option in the same hypertrophy-only substitution list, alongside hack squats, for lifters skipping the heavy squat.', 'experience', 'strong', 2),
