  ('barbell-deadlift', 'band-good-morning', 'full', 'preference', 'A barbell good morning works the same hip-hinge posterior-chain pattern as a deadlift, producing comparable strength and muscle gains without a pull off the floor.', 'mechanistic', 'moderate', 2),
  ('barbell-hack-squat', 'leg-extension', 'partial', 'preference', 'A leg extension isolates the quads directly, so it can substitute for a compound like the hack squat when the goal is purely quad growth.', 'mechanistic', 'moderate', 2),
  ('barbell-row', 'chest-supported-row-machine', 'partial', 'preference', 'On a barbell row the spinal erectors fatigue and become the limiter on quick rest-pause sets; chest support removes that erector demand.', 'mechanistic', 'moderate', 2),
  ('barbell-squat', 'leg-extension', 'partial', 'injury_pain', 'To manage joint stress and fatigue in older or dieting athletes, some heavy squat sets are swapped for leg extension sets while keeping total quad volume up.', 'experience', 'moderate', 2),
