  ('band-skull-crusher', 'assisted-dip-machine', 'partial', 'injury_pain', 'Dips still overload the triceps hard but load the elbow through a different path, letting the spot irritated by skull crushers heal before you return to them.', 'experience', 'moderate', 1),
