  ('barbell-hip-thrust', 'back-squat', 'full', 'time', 'Squats reportedly stimulate the glutes about as well as hip thrusts while also loading the quads, adductors, and lower back in a single lift.', 'mechanistic', 'strong', 1),
  ('barbell-hip-thrust', 'db-step-up', 'full', 'preference', 'Offered as a lower-hassle glute exercise for when he does not want to set up the hip thrust station; trains the glutes in a similar way.', 'experience', 'moderate', 1),
  ('barbell-row', 'lying-t-bar-row', 'partial', 'equipment', 'A T-bar''s lever arm can create a harder, more favorable resistance curve than a typical row, but only with a proper T-bar setup.', 'mechanistic', 'hedged', 1),
